ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536630/extras/e8e2acd948ac3209123a91d5e326f158.mp4?t=1743726489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the materials you obtain to build houses, unique structures, and decorations for Cake Island!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contribute to community projects and help the residents restore the island's infrastructure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Process your materials and the ingredients you produce to fulfill a variety of purposes.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design the town to accommodate all the new residents and their specific needs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a large automation chain to move, process, and store your materials and ingredients.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a true Chef</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover, through different accounts of the legendary pastry chef Valentine Bleu, the true principles of cooking and dare to become a Chef, challenging your limits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Studio SoulAres"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536630/header.jpg?t=1743726489","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3536630/863457/0ffafa2689069f88624be5e988107de222cc2e1b/1750859007/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743726486","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3536630/863457/0ffafa2689069f88624be5e988107de222cc2e1b/1750859007/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743726486","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.ak